      "detailed_description": "Based on the weekly Naver Webtoon 'Random Chat,' this visual novel breathes new life into the story by re-forming it into a dating simulation game!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nA game three years in the making, brought to you by Story Director ZAD and Art Director kero, the team behind 'Some Some Convenience Store' and 'Miracle Snack Shop'!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nExperience something completely new as the story flows away from the source material. Romance 4 girls with 4 totally different personalities in this fully-voiced dating sim.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nSet to release in the first quarter of 2023<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<br />\r\n- A work based on the Naver Webtoon 'Random Chat'<br />\r\n<br />\r\nDate the charming girls from the original webtoon series<br />\r\nEnjoy this love simulation game, even with no knowledge of the original series. <br />\r\nExperience all sorts of new story arcs that weren't featured in the webtoon. <br />\r\n<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<br />\r\n- An expanded story featuring four heroines<br />\r\n<br />\r\nProgress down one of four routes, one for each of our different heroines, for even greater enjoyment and satisfaction.<br />\r\nIn addition to our four heroines, the diverse cast of supporting characters were all dubbed by professional voice actors and actresses to immerse you in this fully-voiced drama.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<br />\r\n- Dive into the world of 'Random Chat' and experience it all firsthand<br />\r\n<br />\r\nRun through the school and side streets that serve as the backdrop of the story.<br />\r\nIt's not only the world that you can delve into, as you can experience school life through side stories that play out on social media and messenger apps.<br />\r\nEnjoy the simulation and gaming aspects that will only add to the story. <br />\r\n<br />\r\n<br />\r\n*. This game is an 18+ rating, but it would be because of the vulgar language, not for overt sexual displays.",
